{
  "id": 8834383216839,
  "title": "Personalized Basketball Held By Hand on Court Blanket with Name and Number",
  "handle": "personalized-basketball-held-by-hand-on-court-blanket-with-name-and-number-079998b76f-079998b76f",
  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in cozy warmth with the Personalized Basketball Blanket from Jeminise. This soft, comfortable blanket features a unique sports-themed digital illustration, making it the perfect companion for snuggling on the sofa, relaxing on the couch, or staying warm during outdoor camping and picnics.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize your blanket with a custom name and custom number for a truly unique gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Materials:</strong> Crafted with two layers of premium polyester fabric, available in cozy Fleece or plush Sherpa options.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Multiple Sizes:</strong> Choose the perfect fit for your needs from four available sizes, including Small (40x30\"), Medium (50x40\"), Large (60x50\"), and X-Large (80x60\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vibrant Artwork:</strong> Uses long-lasting color ink to display a vivid digital illustration of a basketball held by hand on the court.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; dries quickly on a low-heat air dry or air dry setting to remain fluffy and soft.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Excellent for napping, reading, travel, camping, and enjoying indoor or outdoor cozy moments in all seasons.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Fleece/Sherpa</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sports</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Basketball, Game</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), X-Large (80x60 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
